   "q_en": "<p>The inner and outer radii of a circular track are 28 m and 25 m, respectively. The cost of levelling the track at 28 per m<sup>2</sup> is:</p>",
   "q_hi": "&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2325; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 28 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; 25 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; 28 &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2368;<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2340;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;:",
   "options_en": [
    "15421",
    "13992",
    "11229",
    "17355"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "15421",
    "13992",
    "11229",
    "17355"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>Inner radius of the circular track =25 m </p><p>Outer radius of the circular track = 28m </p><p>Cost of leveling the track = &#2352;28 per m<sup>2</sup></p><p>Area of a circular track=&#960;(R<sup>2</sup>-r<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Area of the track = 22/7(28<sup>2</sup>-25<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Area=159*22/7 m<sup>2</sup></p><p>Cost of levelling = Area x Cost</p><p>22/7 X 159x28</p><p>22 X 159 X 4=Rs.13992</p><p>:The correct answer is option (b).</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Inner radius of the circular track =25 m </p><p>Outer radius of the circular track = 28m </p><p>Cost of leveling the track = &#2352;28 per m<sup>2</sup></p><p>Area of a circular track=&#960;(R<sup>2</sup>-r<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Area of the track = 22/7(28<sup>2</sup>-25<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Area=159*22/7 m<sup>2</sup></p><p>Cost of levelling = Area x Cost</p><p>22/7 X 159x28</p><p>22 X 159 X 4=Rs.13992</p><p>:The correct answer is option (b).</p>",
