   "q_en": "<p>The radii of two circles are 8 cm and 15 cm.The perimeter of the circle having area equal to the sum of the areas of the two circles (in cm) is:</p>",
   "q_hi": "&#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; 8 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; 15 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; (&#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2346; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
   "options_en": [
    "32&#960;",
    "30&#960;",
    "28&#960;",
    "34&#960;"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "32&#960;",
    "30&#960;",
    "28&#960;",
    "34&#960;"
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Radius of two circles are 8 cm and 15 cm respectively.</p><p>Given that area of new circle = sum of area of both circle</p><p>So area of new circle = &#960; * 8<sup>2</sup> + &#960;*15<sup>2</sup></p><p>= &#960; *( 64+ 225)</p><p>= &#960; *(289)</p><p>So &#960; *R<sup>2</sup> = &#960;*289</p><p>So R = 17</p><p>Now perimeter = 2*&#960;*R= 2*&#960; *17 =34&#960;</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Radius of two circles are 8 cm and 15 cm respectively.</p><p>Given that area of new circle = sum of area of both circle</p><p>So area of new circle = &#960; * 8<sup>2</sup> + &#960;*15<sup>2</sup></p><p>= &#960; *( 64+ 225)</p><p>= &#960; *(289)</p><p>So &#960; *R<sup>2</sup> = &#960;*289</p><p>So R = 17</p><p>Now perimeter = 2*&#960;*R= 2*&#960; *17 =34&#960;</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>",
