   "q_en": "<p>A circular clock has the hour hand of length 6 inch. Find the length of the distance it covers by it's tip from 9 p.m. to 3 a.m.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2328;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2370;&#2312; 6 &#2311;&#2306;&#2330; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2309;&#2346;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; 9 &#2348;&#2332;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; 3 &#2348;&#2332;&#2375; &#2340;&#2325; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2379;&#2325; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2340;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "4&#960; inch",
    "2&#960; inch",
    "6&#960; inch",
    "8&#960; inch"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "4&#960; &#2311;&#2306;&#2330;",
    "2&#960; &#2311;&#2306;&#2330;",
    "6&#960; &#2311;&#2306;&#2330;",
    "8&#960; &#2311;&#2306;&#2330;"
   ],
   "answer": 2,
   "solution_en": "<p>The path traveled by tip of the hour hand over the course of 12 hours = 2&#960;r</p><p>So, path traveled by tip of the hour hand over the course of 6 hours (i.e, 9 p.m. to 3 a.m) = 1/2 * 2&#960; * 6 = 6&#960; inch</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>The path traveled by tip of the hour hand over the course of 12 hours = 2&#960;r</p><p>So, path traveled by tip of the hour hand over the course of 6 hours (i.e, 9 p.m. to 3 a.m) = 1/2 * 2&#960; * 6 = 6&#960; inch</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
