   "q_en": "<p>A race track is in the shape of a ring whose inner and outer circumferences are 440 m and 506 m, respectively. What is the cost of levelling the track at Rs. 6/m<sup>2</sup>? (Take &pi; = 22/7 )</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2352;&#2375;&#2360; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2325; &#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2368; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2343;&#2367; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 440 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; 506 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; 6 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;/m<sup>2</sup> &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2340;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? (&#960; = 22/7 &#2354;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;)</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "Rs. 18,966",
    "Rs. 24,832",
    "Rs. 19,866",
    "Rs. 29,799"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "18,966 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;",
    "24,832 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;",
    "19,866 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;",
    "29,799 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Let inner radius and outer radius are r cm and R cm respectively.</p><p>Given,</p><p>2 * &#960; * r = 440</p><p>2 * (22/7) * r = 440</p><p>r = 70 m</p><p>And</p><p>2 * &#960; * R = 506</p><p>2 * (22/7) * R = 506</p><p>R = 80.5 m</p><p>Area covered by track = &#960; * R * R  -  &#960; * r * r</p><p>= (22/7) * (80.5<sup>2</sup>  -  70<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (22/7) * (80.5 + 70) * (80 .5  -  70)</p><p>= (22/7) * 150.5 * 10.5</p><p>= (22/7) * 150.5 * 1.5</p><p>= 4966.5 sq. m</p><p>Cost of levelling 1 sq. m = Rs.6</p><p>Cost of levelling 4966.5 sq. m = 6 * 4966.5 = Rs.29799</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Let inner radius and outer radius are r cm and R cm respectively.</p><p>Given,</p><p>2 * &#960; * r = 440</p><p>2 * (22/7) * r = 440</p><p>r = 70 m</p><p>And</p><p>2 * &#960; * R = 506</p><p>2 * (22/7) * R = 506</p><p>R = 80.5 m</p><p>Area covered by track = &#960; * R * R  -  &#960; * r * r</p><p>= (22/7) * (80.5<sup>2</sup>  -  70<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (22/7) * (80.5 + 70) * (80 .5  -  70)</p><p>= (22/7) * 150.5 * 10.5</p><p>= (22/7) * 150.5 * 1.5</p><p>= 4966.5 sq. m</p><p>Cost of levelling 1 sq. m = Rs.6</p><p>Cost of levelling 4966.5 sq. m = 6 * 4966.5 = Rs.29799</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
