   "solution_en": "<p>Area is directly proportional to the square of side of triangle.</p><p>Increase area: Original area = (Increase side)<sup>2</sup>: (Original side)<sup>2</sup></p><p>Increase area: Original area = (134)<sup>2</sup>: (100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>Increase area: Original area = (67/50)<sup>2</sup> = 4489/2500</p><p>Percent increase in area = [(4489  -  2500)/2500] * 100</p><p>= 79.56%</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Area is directly proportional to the square of side of triangle.</p><p>Increase area: Original area = (Increase side)<sup>2</sup>: (Original side)<sup>2</sup></p><p>Increase area: Original area = (134)<sup>2</sup>: (100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>Increase area: Original area = (67/50)<sup>2</sup> = 4489/2500</p><p>Percent increase in area = [(4489  -  2500)/2500] * 100</p><p>= 79.56%</p>",
